WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:02.470
Gainos.

00:00:02.470 --> 00:00:05.000
The ruling continent of the Queen's capital.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.150
For the purpose of becoming the new Queen, many warriors are aiming for that place.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:12.540
They place within their swords the feelings of ambition that are hidden within them.

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:15.710
Thus, the burning competition, Queen's Blade, continues.

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:25.960
Now, don't move from here until I get back.

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:29.140
Are you going to help that lady?

00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:30.170
I'll go, too.

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:31.200
Rana...

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:37.130
All right, but don't ever stray from my side.

00:00:37.130 --> 00:00:37.850
Okay.

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:41.810
Good, shall we go, then?

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:46.100
I can't let your weapons take all the fame.

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:19.760
We don't have time to play with you!

00:01:20.030 --> 00:01:24.810
Don't be so cold. Keep us entertained for a bit.

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:31.650
Rest assured, we'll take care of you after we settle Queen's Blade.

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:37.240
Sorry to disappoint you, but you're the ones who are going to be taken care of.

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:44.990
kagata kure hikaru yo mayoi wo uchi keshite

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:44.990
かがたくれ光るよ迷いを打ち消し

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:44.990
The blazing light will chase the doubts away

00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:53.710
yowake ga kuru no nara osorezuni kono DOOR wo hirakao

00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:53.710
よわけが来るのなら恐れ済みこのドアを平子

00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:53.710
And when the dawn comes the door will open

00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:09.710
Moshimo itsuka hohoende kureru hi ga kuru nara

00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:09.710
もしもいつか微笑んでくれる日がくるなら

00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:09.710
If there ever comes a day where you can smile

00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:16.230
sore wa kitto nani ka ga kawatte shunkan

00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:16.230
それはきっと何かが変わって瞬間

00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:16.230
Something will definitely change in that moment

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:21.900
tsuyoku naritai no negau yori mo ima wa

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:21.900
強くなりたいの願うよりも今は

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:21.900
It is now my wish to become strong

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:28.530
tada tsuyoku naru no ka watashi dake ga moteru

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:28.530
ただ強くならのか私だけが持てる

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:28.530
Is becoming strong all that I can hope for?

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:34.700
kotae wo shiritai

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:34.700
答えを知りたい

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:34.700
I want to know the answer

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:41.590
kagata kure hikaru yo mayoi wo uchikeshite

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:41.590
かがたくれ光るよ迷いを打ち消し

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:41.590
The blazing light will chase the doubts away

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:47.840
omoi de bakari wo nazoru dake ja naku

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:47.840
重いでばかりを謎るだけじゃなく

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:47.840
My feelings do nothing but puzzle me

00:02:48.010 --> 00:02:54.020
kore kara kaerareru mirai ga hajimaru

00:02:48.010 --> 00:02:54.020
是から帰られる未来が始まる

00:02:48.010 --> 00:02:54.020
From now on I will change, my future is beginning

00:02:54.220 --> 00:03:04.120
yoake ga kuru no nara osorezuni kono DOOR wo hiraka wo

00:02:54.220 --> 00:03:04.120
夜明けが来るのなら恐れずにこのドアを平鹿

00:02:54.220 --> 00:03:04.120
And when the dawn comes, the door will open

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:17.190
Saint Melpha, the Witch of the Swampland will eventually be killed.

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:18.750
However, it is not yet time.

00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:21.640
But at this rate...

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:25.860
I shall display the power of the Queen to those of the continent.

00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:29.100
Have the angel outside announce the start of Queen's Blade.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:34.390
Don't the rules state that only one-on-one duels are allowed?

00:03:34.390 --> 00:03:35.310
It does not matter.

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:38.360
Allow the demons to participate, as well.

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:43.950
With this, I might see an interesting battle.

00:03:46.190 --> 00:03:46.780
Watch out!

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:09.060
Elina-sama!

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:16.170
Do not falter!

00:04:16.170 --> 00:04:18.190
Protect Elina-sama!

00:04:32.530 --> 00:04:34.160
Useless servants!

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:40.380
Even though Gainos is right before our eyes...

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:42.800
I cannot...

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:47.340
afford to be halted here.

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:49.140
Even if I am injured,

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:51.860
you weaklings stand no chance against me!

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:03.860
Melona!

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:06.330
Oh, Leina.

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:07.570
Just where do you think you're going?

00:05:17.610 --> 00:05:19.760
Is this... a barrier?

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:21.260
Looks like it.

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:23.590
An anti-demon defense.

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:26.050
At any rate, we've all passed through safely.

00:05:26.390 --> 00:05:27.510
Onee-chan?

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:30.340
Leina!

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:34.340
Oh, my...

00:05:34.340 --> 00:05:36.100
Leina got left behind.

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:38.880
She sure has it rough.

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:45.200
If I were to save her in some amazing way, she'd be in my debt for life!

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:49.700
But if I do something unnecessary, the Head Angel will yell at me again...

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:54.950
That light... it's almost as if it were calling me.

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:56.080
What is it?

00:05:56.490 --> 00:05:58.710
I guess I should go check it out!

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:03.560
Now, Leina, shall we begin?

00:06:03.560 --> 00:06:05.550
I won't allow you to take her!

00:06:05.750 --> 00:06:08.580
Leina-sama is going to be my delicious meal.

00:06:08.580 --> 00:06:12.180
Her spirit has distinguished itself to be of much finer quality.

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:15.020
It is truly delectable.

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:18.390
How rude of you to be stealing another's prey.

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:21.390
That is my slave.

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:25.570
Yeah, this lady sure is my type.

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:28.940
What nonsense are you two talking about?

00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:34.780
As for you, Melona-san, weren't Master's orders for you to annihilate everyone here?

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:37.870
I can leave the others for later.

00:06:41.070 --> 00:06:42.810
That's right.

00:06:42.810 --> 00:06:46.460
They can all become my slaves later.

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:51.050
Here I come, Leina.

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:58.060
Are you the one who called me?

00:06:58.380 --> 00:07:00.800
Yes, Miss Angel.

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:03.020
I am Melpha.

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:09.440
They're here, too... these abnormally large breasts...

00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:13.330
I've come as a messenger of Queen Aldra.

00:07:13.330 --> 00:07:14.350
Aldra?

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:18.750
I'll defeat all three of you!

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:21.880
It's my turn next.

00:07:24.430 --> 00:07:27.290
I hope you haven't forgotten about me.

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:35.720
Ru!

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:38.310
Nowa.

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:40.350
Long time no see, Leina.

00:07:42.490 --> 00:07:44.920
Yeah, long time no see.

00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:47.030
Nowa, behind you!

00:07:47.720 --> 00:07:51.740
Long time no see, Mr. Monkey!

00:07:57.350 --> 00:07:58.490
Vulgar spirits!

00:08:01.270 --> 00:08:02.290
Shit!

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:06.580
Now, open wide!

00:08:06.930 --> 00:08:10.140
All right, a direct, clean battle of Queen's Blade.

00:08:10.140 --> 00:08:11.900
Isn't this great?

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:14.380
Melpha, you do your part, too.

00:08:14.740 --> 00:08:16.510
I understand.

00:08:16.620 --> 00:08:18.390
Now, let's go!

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:23.700
I'm terribly sorry, Miss Angel.

00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:25.050
That was on purpose.

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:26.560
That was so on purpose.

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:29.230
No, not at all.

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:37.990
This mixture of elf and human life energy... I can't hold myself back!

00:08:40.220 --> 00:08:42.160
Nowa, zero points!

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:46.830
Instructor!

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:50.710
Nowa, why are you fooling around?

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:54.370
You came to see me, Instructor?

00:08:54.370 --> 00:08:55.380
Do not cry.

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:56.850
You must fight.

00:09:01.670 --> 00:09:04.540
That kind of pissed me off.

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:07.420
I'm going to kill you both now.

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:08.690
I hope you're prepared.

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:10.610
Damn it, you're in the way!

00:09:11.100 --> 00:09:13.980
I need to go to where Leina is!

00:09:16.330 --> 00:09:16.820
Shi{fscx200}-

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:27.320
I doubt you can fight very well with that broken sword.

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:29.040
You should hurry and get it fixed.

00:09:29.140 --> 00:09:32.650
If you need your sword repaired, how about letting us dwarves handle it?

00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:33.960
I'll make it cheap.

00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:42.890
You weaklings don't stand a chance!

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:49.520
Look at all these options!

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:51.060
I don't know who to choose.

00:09:51.060 --> 00:09:52.190
Setra?

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:54.250
Where are you going?

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:58.950
All right, here I go!

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:02.040
Warriors who wish to participate in Queen's Blade,

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:06.580
in the name of the angel, Nanael, begin the battle to determine the winner!

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:13.590
That idiot angel actually did something worthwhile.

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:16.510
I'm finally starting to get excited.

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:22.040
Vagrant Warrior, Leina!

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:24.650
Imperial Commander, Elina!

00:10:24.650 --> 00:10:27.090
Lightning General, Claudette!

00:10:27.840 --> 00:10:29.270
Warrior Priestess, Tomoe!

00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:31.450
Weaponsmith, Cattleya!

00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:33.110
Steel Princess, Ymir!

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:35.520
Combat Instructor, Alleyne!

00:10:36.050 --> 00:10:37.780
Forest Guardian, Nowa!

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:40.530
Chivalrous Thief, Risty!

00:10:41.130 --> 00:10:44.120
And finally, Saint of the Gates, Melpha!

00:10:44.480 --> 00:10:47.060
Holy Pose{, maybe something}!

00:10:50.390 --> 00:10:51.410
The opposing team:

00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:54.160
Maid of Temptation, Airi!

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:56.250
Ancient Queen, Menace!

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:58.630
Assassin of Many Faces, Melona!

00:11:05.660 --> 00:11:07.300
Only because I owe you.

00:11:08.570 --> 00:11:09.560
Risty.

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:12.340
That was amazing.

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:15.020
You smashed up those phantoms in one blow!

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:18.980
I couldn't stand to watch those demons wreaking havoc at the capital.

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:26.530
You sure don't have many tricks for an assassin of many faces.

00:11:26.690 --> 00:11:29.050
All right, I'll show it to you, then.

00:11:29.050 --> 00:11:32.160
The true meaning behind my title.

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:43.880
Onee-chan!

00:11:44.730 --> 00:11:46.870
Your irresponsibility is unforgivable!

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:09.590
Just as I thought, you're weak.

00:12:09.590 --> 00:12:11.020
Demon Exorcism!

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:20.490
Are you okay, Leina-san?

00:12:20.490 --> 00:12:21.340
Tomoe.

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:23.510
You'll fight with me?

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:24.960
Of course.

00:12:25.540 --> 00:12:28.930
You are the first friend I've made on this continent.

00:12:29.590 --> 00:12:32.920
We'll begin by dealing with this shameless demon.

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:35.700
Fatal technique: Helmet Slash!

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:42.780
That technique...

00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:45.780
Warrior Kick... was it?

00:12:51.980 --> 00:12:53.490
Shizuka-san.

00:12:53.490 --> 00:12:55.000
Tomoe-sama, are you hurt?

00:12:55.520 --> 00:12:56.520
I'm fine.

00:12:58.660 --> 00:13:02.570
She's my number one, after all.

00:13:03.600 --> 00:13:05.510
I cannot afford to fall behind.

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:13.460
Hey, Princess, she's gotten stronger all of a sudden.

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:16.730
I'm... starting to get tired.

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:29.720
<i>These two are completely synced.</i>

00:13:29.720 --> 00:13:31.410
<i>I can't find an opening.</i>

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:34.330
How about this form?

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:45.510
What's fake is fake!

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:48.090
Why don't you try me, Leina?

00:13:58.860 --> 00:14:01.230
You wouldn't die from something like that, would you?

00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:07.990
I've always wanted to see the outside world.

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:12.160
How does it feel to be killed by your clone?

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:15.870
There is no beauty in an attack that comes from a demon.

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:21.250
But I never thought that it would be so much fun to fight myself.

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:24.840
Your Dragon Tail is fake!

00:14:25.310 --> 00:14:26.750
That's a bluff!

00:14:27.080 --> 00:14:29.220
My technique is perfect!

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:38.680
Dragon Tail!

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:41.010
Wh-What?!

00:14:41.010 --> 00:14:42.100
This power...

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:48.360
What now, Princess?

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:50.930
The odds are against us now.

00:14:50.930 --> 00:14:52.590
That's true...

00:14:52.590 --> 00:14:55.930
I believe we should fall back for now...

00:14:55.930 --> 00:14:57.540
It's nowhere near over yet!

00:14:57.940 --> 00:15:00.760
Oh being of darkness, buried deep beneath the soil.

00:15:00.760 --> 00:15:02.750
Hey, are you serious?!

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:06.960
You did this on your own. If Master gets upset about this, I'm not defending you!

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:20.450
In the name of the Assassin of Many Faces, Melona,

00:15:20.450 --> 00:15:23.720
show thyself here on this plane!

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:37.910
W-Wait a minute!

00:15:38.640 --> 00:15:40.330
You've got to be kidding me.

00:16:03.710 --> 00:16:04.780
Hey, hey!

00:16:04.780 --> 00:16:06.540
Is she all right?

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:07.690
Huh?

00:16:07.690 --> 00:16:09.520
Where did Airi-san go?

00:16:09.520 --> 00:16:11.360
She ran off on her own!

00:16:11.970 --> 00:16:15.110
We should get out of here too, Princess!

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:17.240
We have no choice, then.

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:20.830
That snake...

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:23.750
I saw her at the Witch's Swamp!

00:16:24.140 --> 00:16:26.550
Why is she here?

00:16:26.550 --> 00:16:27.460
Nanael!

00:16:28.910 --> 00:16:29.880
Leina?!

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:31.800
No!!

00:16:31.890 --> 00:16:34.190
I hate snakes!

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:39.100
Hold on tight.

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:51.570
<i>My body... won't move.</i>

00:17:01.300 --> 00:17:02.510
Claudette-san.

00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:11.400
Onee-sama!

00:17:11.400 --> 00:17:12.430
This is hopeless.

00:17:12.430 --> 00:17:13.710
We don't stand a chance.

00:17:14.080 --> 00:17:17.090
Our best option would be to retreat.

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:24.810
Leina!

00:17:24.930 --> 00:17:26.930
That's too dangerous, Leina-san!

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:32.030
Are you ready, Leina?

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:32.900
Yes.

00:17:37.110 --> 00:17:38.990
I will definitely defeat you!

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:03.680
Oh one who dishonors the sacred Queen's Blade,

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:10.100
turn to stone and repent for your own foolishness.

00:18:18.880 --> 00:18:20.410
Wow.

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:23.690
That's... the power of Queen Aldra?

00:18:47.380 --> 00:18:49.720
Man, I'm glad that's over.

00:18:49.720 --> 00:18:54.340
All in all, it was thanks to my quick and excellent judgment.

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:55.770
Don't get cocky.

00:18:56.370 --> 00:18:59.070
Nanael, can you return to Heaven now?

00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:00.550
Well, of course.

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:04.290
There's no way I'm going to stay in this plain world forever.

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:06.080
I'm finished with my duties here.

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:07.360
I see.

00:19:07.360 --> 00:19:09.020
It's going to be lonely.

00:19:09.020 --> 00:19:10.540
We only just started to get along.

00:19:10.890 --> 00:19:12.350
I guess...

00:19:12.350 --> 00:19:16.460
But there aren't very many angels who are as amazing as I am.

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:17.880
See ya!

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:31.010
Still, I was worried for a second there.

00:19:31.010 --> 00:19:35.070
You went up against that giant snake by yourself, after all.

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:38.930
The courage you showed before that giant enemy...

00:19:38.930 --> 00:19:40.170
It was splendid.

00:19:40.170 --> 00:19:40.820
Right.

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:43.200
You showed quite an admirable spirit.

00:19:43.540 --> 00:19:46.930
Ymir was just screaming the whole time, though.

00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:48.560
What was that, brat?

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:50.490
I can't let that one go!

00:19:52.950 --> 00:19:53.710
Leina.

00:19:54.820 --> 00:19:56.880
Strength and recklessness are two different things.

00:19:56.880 --> 00:19:58.460
Do not mix them up.

00:19:59.450 --> 00:20:01.180
I understand that.

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:04.340
After meeting everyone and fighting with them,

00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:10.060
I now know things I didn't know or have been ignoring.

00:20:10.320 --> 00:20:13.510
Leina still has a promise to fight me.

00:20:13.510 --> 00:20:15.100
Nowa, 40 points.

00:20:15.390 --> 00:20:18.690
You can't bring friendship into the battles to come.

00:20:19.120 --> 00:20:20.690
Not even a little?

00:20:21.270 --> 00:20:24.890
I must apologize to you, Leina-san.

00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:25.770
Eh?

00:20:25.770 --> 00:20:30.790
I didn't think you were worthy of Queen's Blade when I first met you.

00:20:32.820 --> 00:20:36.480
But now, you're always on her mind.

00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:37.720
That's right.

00:20:37.720 --> 00:20:39.260
You're a warrior to watch out for.

00:20:39.260 --> 00:20:42.300
Don't be so arrogant, you country bumpkin.

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:46.200
Onee-chan is mine, and mine alone.

00:20:46.200 --> 00:20:48.220
Hey, Elina... Geez.

00:20:48.650 --> 00:20:51.070
Warriors who have gathered here,

00:20:51.070 --> 00:20:54.110
walk through the gates of my capital, Gainos.

00:20:54.990 --> 00:20:56.060
Come.

00:20:56.440 --> 00:20:59.400
It is now time to select the new Queen.

00:21:05.310 --> 00:21:07.650
The Queen's capital, Gainos.

00:21:07.650 --> 00:21:09.820
Yes, the place we've been aiming for.

00:21:12.480 --> 00:21:13.970
Let's go.

00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:16.120
Her Royal Highness is there.

00:21:22.520 --> 00:21:24.510
You, what is your name?

00:21:31.330 --> 00:21:32.600
<i>I am Leina.</i>

00:21:33.620 --> 00:21:35.860
<i>Vagrant Warrior, Leina.</i>

00:23:14.410 --> 00:23:16.190
Queen's Blade.

00:23:16.190 --> 00:23:21.730
The battle that takes place every four years to determine who will rule as Queen in God's place.

00:23:21.730 --> 00:23:26.430
Many warriors from across the land gathered with different wills...

00:23:26.430 --> 00:23:29.880
to open the gates to the Queen's capital, Gainos.

00:23:29.880 --> 00:23:34.940
All of this was done in order for the strongest and most beautiful Queen to take the throne.

00:23:34.940 --> 00:23:39.350
Who that may be will only be revealed in the battles to come.

00:23:39.350 --> 00:23:43.310
Queen's Blade: Successor to the Throne.
